<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in Supersport series matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein (day four): Free State 401 and 297-9 declared (Deon Jordaan 117, Pieter Strydom 4-52). Border 367-9 declared and 222-5 (Steven Pope 68 not out). Match drawn</p>
<p>In Paarl (day three): Boland 204 and 237 (Adrian Kuiper 82, Andrew Wylie 61). Eastern Province 262 and 17-0.</p>
</text>
